Tighten the external VVdeC decoder's bounds and allocation checks, keep both
HDR SEI side-data records, and respect FFmpeg 9's decoder metadata contract.
This applies after the pinned Fraunhofer FFmpeg integration patch.

--- a/libavcodec/libvvdec.c
